UID:norma-fonds-projectbijdrage-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261105T131848Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
SUMMARY:Deadline: Stichting NORMA: NORMA Fonds Project Grant (round 4\, 202
 6)
DESCRIPTION:The NORMA Fonds redistributes copyright remuneration collected 
 by Stichting NORMA into cultural\, social and professional projects involv
 ing performing artists\, and is one of the few Dutch schemes with four int
 akes a year and a genuinely short cycle.\n\nOrganisation: Stichting NORMA 
 (collecting society for performing artists)\nLocation: Netherlands-based a
 rts-sector activity. No city or region restriction stated.\nAward: Maximum
  EUR 10\,000 per project. Total project budget may not exceed EUR 150\,000
  and the applicant organisation's annual budget may not exceed EUR 500\,00
 0. At least 25 percent of the project budget must come from audience or bo
 x-office revenue. Performer fees must meet the 2026 wage norms of EUR 139 
 per rehearsal and EUR 340 per performance. No application fee.\nDuration: 
 Single project\, typically a production or concert series. Final report du
 e within six months of completion.\n\nMore: https://www.stichtingnorma.nl/
 norma-fonds/aanvragen/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
URL:https://www.stichtingnorma.nl/norma-fonds/aanvragen/?utm_source=artific
 ialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands-based arts-sector activity. No city or region restrict
 ion stated.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:emap-emare-media-art-residencies-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261105T131848Z
