 onals-2026/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Timisoara\, Romania. Mobility must be to or from Timisoara\; open 
 to Romanian and foreign nationals aged 18+ active in cultural professions.
END:VEVENT
