DTSTAMP:20261105T131848Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
SUMMARY:Deadline: ACC Galerie Weimar: 33rd International Studio Program 202
 7\, On Absence
DESCRIPTION:Themed international residency: three artists\, duos or collect
 ives are selected for one of three four-month periods between February 202
 7 and January 2028 to work on the 2027 theme 'On Absence'. Each resident r
 eceives EUR 1\,100 per month and a rent-free furnished studio apartment in
  central Weimar\; the programme closes with a group exhibition the followi
 ng year.\n\nOrganisation: ACC Galerie Weimar and the City of Weimar\nLocat
 ion: Weimar\, Germany. Open worldwide\, all ages\; enrolled students exclu
