 ng fully funded Fellowships for visual artists and curators to live and wo
 rk in Athens. The residency is structured and research-driven\, built arou
 nd arranged studio and private collection visits\, institutional access an
 d community events\, balanced with time for independent work.\n\nOrganisat
 ion: ARCAthens\nLocation: Athens\, Greece (in-person residency). Open to i
 nternational visual artists and curators residing outside Greece.\nAward: 
